      "message": "I\u0027m not quite sure why this is needed, but basically I saw that we were timing out waiting for the last bit of the EOP. This only happened when the last bit was a high on the CC line because when the last bit is low, we insert an additional 0 into the communication. So, without the additional 0, we miss the last bit of the EOP.\n\nInterestingly, this patch worked on zinger with waiting for 5 bits in the EOP, so it probably depends on how fast the line rises after the last bit.",
